<h1 class="greeting">Welcome to Vorkana, {{name}}! 👋</h1>

<p class="message">
    Thank you for creating an account with Vorkana. We're excited to have you join our community of talented professionals.
</p>

<div class="alert alert-info">
    <strong>Almost there!</strong> To complete your registration and access all features, please verify your email address.
</div>

<div class="btn-center">
    <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" class="btn">{{buttonText}}</a>
</div>

<p class="message">
    <strong>Or copy this link to your browser:</strong>
</p>

<div class="code-block">
    {{verificationUrl}}
</div>

<div class="alert alert-warning">
    <strong>Important:</strong> This verification link expires in <strong>{{expiresIn}}</strong>. 
    If it expires, you can request a new verification email from your account settings.
</div>

<h3 style="color: #111827; margin: 32px 0 16px 0;">Once verified, you can:</h3>

<ul class="features-list">
    <li>Create and manage your professional gigs</li>
    <li>Browse and order services from talented professionals</li>
    <li>Build your reputation with reviews and ratings</li>
    <li>Access premium features as you grow</li>
    <li>Connect with clients and freelancers worldwide</li>
</ul>

<p class="message" style="margin-top: 32px;">
    <strong>Didn't create this account?</strong> 
    If you didn't sign up for Vorkana, you can safely ignore this email. 
    The account will be automatically removed if not verified.
</p>

<p class="message" style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">
    Need help? Contact our support team at 
    <a href="mailto:{{supportEmail}}" style="color: #10b981;">{{supportEmail}}</a>
</p>